{"question_id":"lsbmt320","content":"Given below are two statements :<br/><br/>\n<b>Statement (I)</b> : Aminobenzene and aniline are same organic compounds.<br/><br/>\n<b>Statement (II)</b> : Aminobenzene and aniline are different organic compounds.<br/><br/>\nIn the light of the above statements, choose the <b>most appropriate</b> answer from the options given below :","chapter":"compounds-containing-nitrogen","chapterGroup":"organic-chemistry","country":"in","difficulty":"easy","exam":"jee-main","examGroup":"jee","isBonus":false,"isOutOfSyllabus":false,"languages":["en"],"marks":4,"negMarks":1,"paperId":"jee-main-2024-online-1st-february-morning-shift","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2024 (Online) 1st February Morning Shift","permalink":"given-below-are-two-statements-brbr-bstatement-i-jee-main-chemistry-dpen5ibnd1xjteoc","question":{"en":{"comprehension":null,"direction":null,"content":"Given below are two statements :<br/><br/>\n<b>Statement (I)</b> : Aminobenzene and aniline are same organic compounds.<br/><br/>\n<b>Statement (II)</b> : Aminobenzene and aniline are different organic compounds.<br/><br/>\nIn the light of the above statements, choose the <b>most appropriate</b> answer from the options given below :","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"Both Statement I and Statement II are correct"},{"identifier":"B","content":"Statement I is incorrect but Statement II is correct"},{"identifier":"C","content":"Statement I is correct but Statement II is incorrect"},{"identifier":"D","content":"Both Statement I and Statement II are incorrect"}],"correct_options":["C"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>Statement (I) says that aminobenzene and aniline are the same organic compounds. Statement (II) says that aminobenzene and aniline are different organic compounds. To evaluate these statements, let's examine what each name refers to.</p>\n\n<p>Aminobenzene and aniline both refer to the same compound, which has the chemical formula <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10.35ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 4574.7 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(748,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1151.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(864,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2419.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(3307.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(864,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>. This molecule consists of a benzene ring with an amino group (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.877ex\" height=\"1.885ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 2155.6 833\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(888,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(864,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) attached to it. Aminobenzene is a name that describes the structure based on its functional groups - an amino group attached to a benzene ring. Aniline is the common name for this compound and is recognized by IUPAC as an acceptable name.</p>\n\n<p>Given this information:</p>\n<p>Statement I is correct because aminobenzene and aniline refer to the same compound, that is, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10.35ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 4574.7 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(748,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1151.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(864,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2419.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(3307.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(864,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>.</p>\n<p>Statement II is incorrect because it states that aminobenzene and aniline are different organic compounds, which is not true.</p>\n\n<p>Therefore, the most appropriate answer from the given options is:</p>\n<p>Option C\nStatement I is correct but Statement II is incorrect.</p>"},"hi":{"comprehension":null,"direction":null,"content":"\u0928\u0940\u091a\u0947 \u0926\u094b \u0915\u0925\u0928 \u0926\u093f\u090f \u0917\u090f \u0939\u0948\u0902:<br/><br/>\n<b>\u0915\u0925\u0928 (I)</b> : \u090f\u092e\u093f\u0928\u094b\u092c\u0947\u0928\u094d\u095b\u0940\u0928 \u0914\u0930 \u090f\u0928\u093f\u0932\u093f\u0928 \u090f\u0915 \u0939\u0940 \u091c\u0948\u0935\u093f\u0915 \u092f\u094c\u0917\u093f\u0915 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964<br/><br/>\n<b>\u0915\u0925\u0928 (II)</b> : \u090f\u092e\u093f\u0928\u094b\u092c\u0947\u0928\u094d\u095b\u0940\u0928 \u0914\u0930 \u090f\u0928\u093f\u0932\u093f\u0928 \u092d\u093f\u0928\u094d\u0928 \u091c\u0948\u0935\u093f\u0915 \u092f\u094c\u0917\u093f\u0915 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964<br/><br/>\n\u0909\u092a\u0930\u094d\u092f\u0941\u0915\u094d\u0924 \u0915\u0925\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0947 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0915\u093e\u0936 \u092e\u0947\u0902, \u0928\u0940\u091a\u0947 \u0926\u093f\u090f \u0917\u090f \u0935\u093f\u0915\u0932\u094d\u092a\u094b\u0902 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0938\u0947 <b>\u0938\u092c\u0938\u0947 \u0909\u092a\u092f\u0941\u0915\u094d\u0924</b> \u0909\u0924\u094d\u0924\u0930 \u091a\u0941\u0928\u0947\u0902 :","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"\u0915\u0925\u0928 I \u0914\u0930 \u0915\u0925\u0928 II \u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0938\u0939\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0902"},{"identifier":"B","content":"\u0915\u0925\u0928 I \u0917\u0932\u0924 \u0939\u0948 \u0932\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0928 \u0915\u0925\u0928 II \u0938\u0939\u0940 \u0939\u0948"},{"identifier":"C","content":"\u0915\u0925\u0928 I \u0938\u0939\u0940 \u0939\u0948 \u0932\u0947\u0915\u093f\u0928 \u0915\u0925\u0928 II \u0917\u0932\u0924 \u0939\u0948"},{"identifier":"D","content":"\u0915\u0925\u0928 I \u0914\u0930 \u0915\u0925\u0928 II \u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0917\u0932\u0924 \u0939\u0948\u0902"}],"correct_options":["C"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>\u0915\u0925\u0928 (I) \u0915\u0939\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u0915\u093f \u090f\u092e\u093f\u0928\u094b\u092c\u0947\u0902\u091c\u0940\u0928 \u0914\u0930 \u090f\u0928\u093f\u0932\u0940\u0928 \u090f\u0915 \u0939\u0940 \u0915\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092c\u0928\u093f\u0915 \u092f\u094c\u0917\u093f\u0915 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964 \u0915\u0925\u0928 (II) \u0915\u0939\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u0915\u093f \u090f\u092e\u093f\u0928\u094b\u092c\u0947\u0902\u091c\u0940\u0928 \u0914\u0930 \u090f\u0928\u093f\u0932\u0940\u0928 \u092d\u093f\u0928\u094d\u0928 \u0915\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092c\u0928\u093f\u0915 \u092f\u094c\u0917\u093f\u0915 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964 \u0907\u0928 \u0915\u0925\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u093e \u092e\u0942\u0932\u094d\u092f\u093e\u0902\u0915\u0928 \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f, \u0906\u0907\u090f \u091c\u093e\u0928\u0947\u0902 \u0915\u093f \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0924\u094d\u092f\u0947\u0915 \u0928\u093e\u092e \u0915\u093f\u0938\u0947 \u0938\u0902\u0926\u0930\u094d\u092d\u093f\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964</p>\n\n<p>\u090f\u092e\u093f\u0928\u094b\u092c\u0947\u0902\u091c\u0940\u0928 \u0914\u0930 \u090f\u0928\u093f\u0932\u0940\u0928 \u0926\u094b\u0928\u094b\u0902 \u090f\u0915 \u0939\u0940 \u092f\u094c\u0917\u093f\u0915 \u0915\u094b \u0938\u0902\u0926\u0930\u094d\u092d\u093f\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902, \u091c\u093f\u0938\u0915\u093e \u0930\u093e\u0938\u093e\u092f\u0928\u093f\u0915 \u0938\u0942\u0924\u094d\u0930 <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10.35ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 4574.7 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(748,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1151.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(864,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2419.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(3307.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(864,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u092f\u0939 \u0905\u0923\u0941 \u090f\u0915 \u092c\u0947\u0902\u091c\u0940\u0928 \u0935\u0932\u092f \u0938\u0947 \u092e\u093f\u0932\u0915\u0930 \u092c\u0928\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u091c\u093f\u0938\u092e\u0947\u0902 \u090f\u0915 \u090f\u092e\u093f\u0928\u094b \u0938\u092e\u0942\u0939 (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.877ex\" height=\"1.885ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 2155.6 833\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(888,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(864,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) \u091c\u0941\u0921\u093c\u093e \u0939\u094b\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u090f\u092e\u093f\u0928\u094b\u092c\u0947\u0902\u091c\u0940\u0928 \u090f\u0915 \u0928\u093e\u092e \u0939\u0948 \u091c\u094b \u0907\u0938\u0915\u0940 \u0938\u0902\u0930\u091a\u0928\u093e \u0915\u094b \u0907\u0938\u0915\u0947 \u0915\u094d\u0930\u093f\u092f\u093e\u0924\u094d\u092e\u0915 \u0938\u092e\u0942\u0939\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u0947 \u0906\u0927\u093e\u0930 \u092a\u0930 \u0935\u0930\u094d\u0923\u093f\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948 - \u090f\u0915 \u092c\u0947\u0902\u091c\u0940\u0928 \u0935\u0932\u092f \u0938\u0947 \u091c\u0941\u0921\u093c\u093e \u090f\u0915 \u090f\u092e\u093f\u0928\u094b \u0938\u092e\u0942\u0939\u0964 \u090f\u0928\u093f\u0932\u0940\u0928 \u0907\u0938 \u092f\u094c\u0917\u093f\u0915 \u0915\u093e \u0938\u093e\u092e\u093e\u0928\u094d\u092f \u0928\u093e\u092e \u0939\u0948 \u0914\u0930 IUPAC \u0926\u094d\u0935\u093e\u0930\u093e \u0938\u094d\u0935\u0940\u0915\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092f \u0928\u093e\u092e \u0915\u0947 \u0930\u0942\u092a \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092e\u093e\u0928\u094d\u092f\u0924\u093e \u092a\u094d\u0930\u093e\u092a\u094d\u0924 \u0939\u0948\u0964</p>\n\n<p>\u0907\u0938 \u091c\u093e\u0928\u0915\u093e\u0930\u0940 \u0915\u094b \u0926\u0947\u0916\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0941\u090f:</p>\n<p>\u0915\u0925\u0928 I \u0938\u0939\u0940 \u0939\u0948 \u0915\u094d\u092f\u094b\u0902\u0915\u093f \u090f\u092e\u093f\u0928\u094b\u092c\u0947\u0902\u091c\u0940\u0928 \u0914\u0930 \u090f\u0928\u093f\u0932\u0940\u0928 \u090f\u0915 \u0939\u0940 \u092f\u094c\u0917\u093f\u0915 \u0915\u094b \u0938\u0902\u0926\u0930\u094d\u092d\u093f\u0924 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902, \u0905\u0930\u094d\u0925\u093e\u0924\u094d, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.375ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10.35ex\" height=\"1.97ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 4574.7 870.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D436\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D436\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(748,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(1151.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(864,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2419.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(3307.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D43B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(864,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>\u0964</p>\n<p>\u0915\u0925\u0928 II \u0917\u0932\u0924 \u0939\u0948 \u0915\u094d\u092f\u094b\u0902\u0915\u093f \u092f\u0939 \u0915\u0939\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u0915\u093f \u090f\u092e\u093f\u0928\u094b\u092c\u0947\u0902\u091c\u0940\u0928 \u0914\u0930 \u090f\u0928\u093f\u0932\u0940\u0928 \u092d\u093f\u0928\u094d\u0928 \u0915\u093e\u0930\u094d\u092c\u0928\u093f\u0915 \u092f\u094c\u0917\u093f\u0915 \u0939\u0948\u0902, \u091c\u094b \u0938\u0924\u094d\u092f \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u0948\u0964</p>\n\n<p>\u0907\u0938\u0932\u093f\u090f, \u0926\u093f\u090f \u0917\u090f \u0935\u093f\u0915\u0932\u094d\u092a\u094b\u0902 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0938\u0947 \u0938\u092c\u0938\u0947 \u0909\u092a\u092f\u0941\u0915\u094d\u0924 \u0909\u0924\u094d\u0924\u0930 \u0939\u0948:</p>\n<p>